bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Manga List Page" as UI
boundary Router
control MangaController
control MangaService
entity MangaModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open manga list
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /api/manga/get/all?page&limit
activate Router

Router -> MangaController: 3. getAll(page, limit)
activate MangaController

MangaController -> MangaService: 4. getAllManga(page, limit)
activate MangaService

MangaService -> MangaModel: 5. aggregate(pipeline)
activate MangaModel
MangaModel -> MongoDB: 6. Get list story
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> MangaModel: 7. aggregation result
deactivate MongoDB
MangaModel --> MangaService: 8. { data, total }
deactivate MangaModel

MangaService --> MangaController: 9. return data & total
deactivate MangaService

MangaController --> Router: 10. HTTP response
deactivate MangaController

Router --> UI: 11. Response data
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 12. Show manga list
deactivate UI
deactivate User